[[File:Grimtaash.png|thumb|right|220px|Grimtaash the Molator in Dejarik]]
'''Grimtaash''' the [[Molator]] was a figure from [[Alderaanian]] myth. According to legend, Grimtaash protected the [[House of Organa|royal family]] of [[Alderaan]] from traitors, blinding them in frightening flashes of light.<ref name="Challenges">''[[Star Wars: Jedi Challenges]]''</ref> One of the [[Hologram|holographic]] pieces used in the game of [[dejarik]] was shaped after Grimtaash.<ref name="EYNTK">''[[Star Wars: Absolutely Everything You Need to Know]]''</ref> [[Ben Solo]], the son of<ref name="TRoKR1">[[The Rise of Kylo Ren 1|''The Rise of Kylo Ren'' 1]]</ref> the Alderaanian [[Princess]]<ref name="Episode IV">{{Film|IV}}</ref> [[Leia Skywalker Organa Solo|Leia Organa]], [[pilot]]ed a [[starship]] named the [[Grimtaash (starship)|''Grimtaash'']] during his time as a [[Jedi]] [[Padawan|trainee]] under his uncle [[Luke Skywalker]].<ref name="TRoKR1" />

